    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/instructor-of-mathematics-charleston-south-carolina-12626": {
      "title": "Instructor of Mathematics",
      "description": "Instructor of Mathematics in Charleston, South Carolina | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Instructor of Mathematics Charleston Southern University Charleston, South Carolina Share Save Job Apply for This Job Position Overview The College of Science and Mathematics at Charleston Southern University is seeking applications for an Instructor of Mathematics position. Key Responsibilities Teach 24 credit hours per year (12 each major semester). This position may be expected to teach a combination of traditional undergraduate courses on-campus and dual-credit classes taught at local high schools.  Additional responsibilities include serving the university on faculty committees, participating in department meetings and trainings, and performing other tasks as assigned by the departmental chairperson. Qualifications Job Information Job Category: Faculty Careers - Mathematics Education: Master's Degree Related Jobs Adjunct Faculty – College Math for Elementary Teaching Moody Bible Institute Chicago, Illinois Posted - September 8, 2026 View Grants and Research Coordinator Warner University Lake Wales, Florida Posted - September 15, 2026 View Campus Staff Minister - Washington University-St. Louis (Graduate & Faculty Ministry) InterVarsity Christian Fellowship/USA St. Louis, Missouri Posted - September 15, 2026 View Part Time Doctoral Faculty - Artificial Intelligence Anderson University - SC Remote Posted - September 15, 2026 View Campus Staff Minister - Emory University (Graduate & Faculty Ministry) InterVarsity Christian Fellowship/USA Atlanta, Georgia Posted - September 15, 2026 View Residence Life Educator Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 15, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Associate Professor of Finance Nursing Assistant Professor Trending Locations Michigan Charleston, South Carolina South Carolina Virginia Beach, Virginia Birmingham, Alabama Azusa, California Cedarville, Ohio West Palm Beach, Florida California Iowa Texas Grand Rapids, Michigan Longview, Texas ORANGE CITY, Iowa Alabama Virginia Florida Ohio Houston, Texas Trending Companies Samford University Houston Christian University Cedarville University Charleston Southern University Palm Beach Atlantic University Calvin University Regent University Northwestern College LeTourneau University Azusa Pacific University Trending Categories Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Education Executive Faculty Careers - Psychology Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - Mathematics Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Apply for this job Find Jobs By Category Education Executive Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Faculty Careers - Psychology Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Mathematics Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Powered by Web Scribble Solutions , Inc. About Our Work & Mission Our Institutions Leadership Contact Us Join Us Advertise Donate Employment Membership Sponsorship Follow Us Council for Christian Colleges & Universities 20 M Street SE, Suite 350 , Washington, D.C. 20003 202.546.8713"
