    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/assistant-professor-of-biology-charleston-south-carolina-12625": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor of Biology",
      "description": "Assistant Professor of Biology in Charleston, South Carolina | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Assistant Professor of Biology Charleston Southern University Charleston, South Carolina Share Save Job Apply for This Job Summary The Assistant Professor of Biology will be responsible for teaching 24 semester hours per academic year, including both lecture and laboratory components. The faculty member is expected to adhere to university instructional policies, actively participate in departmental and university events, serve on academic committees, and may assist with the management of the university's Greenhouse and Herbarium Museum. Preference will be given to candidates with teaching experience in wildlife biology and introductory biology courses for both majors and non-majors. Work Performed Teach assigned undergraduate biology courses (lecture and lab) across the academic year. Develop course materials, assess student performance, and provide timely feedback. Participate in curriculum development and assessment activities. Attend department meetings, university events, and professional development sessions. Serve on university and departmental committees as assigned. Potentially assist in overseeing the Greenhouse and Herbarium Museum. Perform other duties as assigned in support of the department’s mission. Job Information Job Category: Faculty Careers - Biology/ Life Sciences Education: Doctorate Degree Related Jobs Assistant Professor in Biological and Health Sciences (Expertise in Botany and Ecology who will contribute to the Biology and Conservation and Ecological Health Majors) Wheaton College Wheaton, Illinois Posted - August 27, 2026 View Biology Faculty Northwestern College ORANGE CITY, Iowa Posted - September 2, 2026 View Assistant/ Associate Professor of Biology or Kinesiology Simpson University Redding, California Posted - September 15, 2026 View Part Time Doctoral Faculty - Artificial Intelligence Anderson University - SC Remote Posted - September 15, 2026 View Grants and Research Coordinator Warner University Lake Wales, Florida Posted - September 15, 2026 View Campus Staff Minister - Washington University-St. Louis (Graduate & Faculty Ministry) InterVarsity Christian Fellowship/USA St. Louis, Missouri Posted - September 15, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Associate Professor of Finance Nursing Assistant Professor Trending Locations Virginia Charleston, South Carolina Cedarville, Ohio Azusa, California South Carolina ORANGE CITY, Iowa Iowa Grand Rapids, Michigan West Palm Beach, Florida Houston, Texas Birmingham, Alabama Florida Texas California Alabama Longview, Texas Virginia Beach, Virginia Michigan Ohio Trending Companies Azusa Pacific University Samford University Palm Beach Atlantic University Regent University Northwestern College LeTourneau University Houston Christian University Calvin University Cedarville University Charleston Southern University Trending Categories Executive Faculty Careers - Mathematics Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - Psychology Education Apply for this job Find Jobs By Category Education Executive Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Faculty Careers - Psychology Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Mathematics Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Powered by Web Scribble Solutions , Inc. About Our Work & Mission Our Institutions Leadership Contact Us Join Us Adverti