    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/biola-counseling-center-seeks-next-executive-director-la-mirada-california-12531": {
      "title": "Biola Counseling Center Seeks Next Executive Director",
      "description": "Biola Counseling Center Seeks Next Executive Director in La Mirada, California | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Biola Counseling Center Seeks Next Executive Director FaithSearch Partners La Mirada, California Share Save Job Apply for This Job FaithSearch Partners is pleased to announce its partnership with Biola Counseling Center to assist with their search for a new Executive Director. Founded in Los Angeles in 1908, Biola University is a private, Christ-centered university and a leading institution in Christian higher education, serving more than 5,500 students from around the world. The Biola Counseling Center (BCC) provides counseling services to Biola students, faculty, and staff, as well as to residents of the greater La Mirada and Los Angeles area. The BCC offers consultations, individual therapy, and group therapy, and partners with other campus departments to support student well-being. Its clinicians serve children, adolescents, and adults facing a wide range of concerns, including mental health challenges, family and marital issues, and substance abuse. The next Executive Director will be a highly relational, clinically credible leader who combines active clinical experience and supervision expertise with a deep commitment to student development and training. He or she will provide strategic, clinical, and administrative leadership for the Center that serves both the Biola community and the broader Southern California region, while supporting the clinical training of master's- and doctoral-level psychology trainees. If you are aware of qualified individuals for this unique opportunity, please contact Jacqueline Gustafson at [email protected] or Andy Westmoreland at [email protected] . Interested candidates can also forward a current resume/curriculum vitae via email. All inquiries will be held in strict confidence. Job Information Job Category: Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Counseling Education: Doctorate Degree Position Type: Full Time Related Jobs Internship Training Director, Biola Counseling Center Biola University La Mirada, California Posted - August 31, 2026 View Museum Curator Pepperdine University Malibu, California Posted - July 23, 2026 View Director of Undergraduate Admissions Taylor University Upland, Indiana Posted - August 26, 2026 View Assistant/Associate Professor of Mechanical Engineering (General) Cedarville University Cedarville, Ohio Posted - September 1, 2026 View President The Seattle School of Theology & Psychology Seattle, Washington (Hybrid) Posted - August 25, 2026 View Assistant/Associate Professor of Computer Science Cedarville University Cedarville, Ohio Posted - September 1, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Associate Professor of Finance Nursing Assistant Professor Trending Locations Longview, Texas Alabama Birmingham, Alabama Charleston, South Carolina ORANGE CITY, Iowa Cedarville, Ohio Virginia Beach, Virginia Iowa South Carolina Florida California Virginia Michigan Azusa, California Houston, Texas Texas Grand Rapids, Michigan West Palm Beach, Florida Ohio Trending Companies Azusa Pacific University Cedarville University Samford University Calvin University Charleston Southern University Palm Beach Atlantic University Northwestern College LeTourneau University Houston Christian University Regent University Trending Categories Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Faculty Careers - Mathematics Executive Faculty Careers - Psychology Faculty Careers - Engineering Education Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Apply for this job Find Jobs By Category Education Executive Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Faculty Careers - Psychology Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Mathematics Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Powered by Web Scribble Solutions , Inc. About Our Work & Mission Our Institutions Leadership Contact Us Join Us Advertise Donate Employment Membership Sponsorship Follow Us Council for Christian Colleges & Universities 20 M Street SE, Suite 350 , Washington, D.C. 20003 202.546.8713"
