    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/part-time-faculty-studio-art-anderson-south-carolina-12641": {
      "title": "Part Time Faculty",
      "description": "Part Time Faculty - Studio Art in Anderson, South Carolina | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Part Time Faculty - Studio Art Anderson University - SC Anderson, South Carolina Share Save Job Apply for This Job The South Carolina School of the Arts at Anderson University invites applications for a Part-Time Faculty of Art position in Studio Art. The position is available for August 2026. Anderson University is a comprehensive, liberal arts institution affiliated with the South Carolina Baptist Convention. Candidates with a strong Christian value system, lifestyle, and commitment to the integration of faith and learning are encouraged to apply. Pay rates are commensurate with credentials and experience. Qualified candidates should hold a MFA in studio art, with areas in drawing, painting, foundations, and/or interdisciplinary practices welcome. Candidates should demonstrate a strong record to teach visual art fundamentals. A successful record of teaching at the collegiate level is preferred. An MFA is preferred; MA will be considered. The South Carolina School of the Arts at Anderson University is a nationally recognized school in a NASAD accredited institution that offers robust training for professional visual artists. We mentor students to develop their craft to its fullest potential so they may thrive professionally and serve others through the arts. We believe that intense transformative mentorship inspires the current generation of student artists. The South Carolina School of the Arts offers Bachelor of Arts, Bachelor of Fine Arts, Bachelor of Music, Bachelor of Music Education and Master of Music degrees with majors and concentrations in graphic design, painting and drawing, ceramics/sculpture, art education, photography, musical theatre, theatrical design, acting and directing, dance, commercial music, worship leadership, music education, and performance. Each of the three departments within the South Carolina School of the Arts are fully accredited by their respective national accrediting agencies (NASM, NASAD, and NAST). The Department of Art + Design is accredited by the National Association of Schools of Art and Design. It includes eleven full-time faculty, with the following areas of study: Bachelor of Arts; with concentrations in Painting + Drawing, Photography, 3D Studies (ceramics/sculpture), and Art Education Bachelor of Fine Arts; Graphic Design Art Minors; General Studio, Painting + Drawing, Photography, 3D Studies (ceramics/sculpture), and Art History Availability to teach courses on-site is required. About our Commitment to Fairness in Employment Anderson University does not unlawfully discriminate on the basis of race, color, national or ethnic origin, sex, disability, age, religion, genetic information, veteran or military status, or any other basis on which the University is prohibited from discrimination under the local, state, or federal law, in its employment or in the provision of its services, including but not limited to its programs and activities, admissions, educational policies, scholarship and loan programs, and athletic and other University-administered programs. As a Christian institution of higher education, Anderson University is entitled to certain religious accommodations under federal and state law, including Title IX of the Education Amendments Act and Title VII of the Civil Rights Act. For questions or concerns contact the Office of Human Resources at hr@andersonuniversity.edu . Job Information Job Category: Faculty Careers - Fine and Performing Arts Position Type: Part Time Related Jobs Campus Staff Minister - Emory University (Graduate & Faculty Ministry) InterVarsity Christian Fellowship/USA Atlanta, Georgia Posted - September 15, 2026 View Residence Life Educator Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 15, 2026 View Dean, School of Ministry Palm Beach Atlantic University West Palm Beach, Florida Posted - September 16, 2026 View Part Time Doctoral Faculty - Artificial Intelligence Anderson University - SC Remote Posted - September 15, 2026 View Grants and Research Coordinator Warner University Lake Wales, Florida Posted - September 15, 2026 View Campus Staff Minister - Washington University-St. Louis (Graduate & Faculty Ministry) InterVarsity Christian Fellowship/USA St. Louis, Missouri Posted - September 15, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Associate Professor of Finance Nursing Assistant Professor Trending Locations West Palm Beach, Florida Michigan Texas Alabama Cedarville, Ohio Birmingham, Alabama Florida Charleston, South Carolina Ohio Longview, Texas Virginia Beach, Virginia California South Carolina Anderson, South Carolina Azusa, California Houston, Texas Virginia ORANGE CITY, Iowa Iowa Grand Rapids, Michigan Trending Companies Calvin University Regent University Anderson University - SC LeTourneau University Houston Christian University Azusa Pacific University Palm Beach Atlantic University Northwestern College Samford University Charleston Southern University Cedarville University Trending Categories Faculty Careers - Mathematics Executive Faculty Careers - Other Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Development/Fundraising Faculty Careers - Education Education Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Faculty Careers - Computer science Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Admissions/Registrar Faculty Careers - Psychology Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Faculty Careers - Engineering Apply for this job Find Jobs By Category Education Executive Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Admissions/R