    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/tenure-track-in-mathematics-education-applied-mathematics-or-data-science-upland-indiana-12680": {
      "title": "Tenure Track in Mathematics Education, Applied Mathematics, or Data Science",
      "description": "Tenure Track in Mathematics Education, Applied Mathematics, or Data Science in Upland, Indiana | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Tenure Track in Mathematics Education, Applied Mathematics, or Data Science Taylor University Upland, Indiana Share Save Job Apply for This Job Taylor University is seeking applications and nominations of distinguished candidates to teach in the Department of Mathematics. This is a tenure-track position beginning August 2027. Appointment of rank and salary are dependent upon qualifications and experience. Women and minorities are encouraged to apply. Mission and Commitment Taylor's mission is to develop servant-leaders marked with a passion to minister Christ’s redemptive love, grace, and truth to a world in need. As a community, Taylor faculty, staff, and students commit to living out Christ’s love and truth in the here and now. We worship together, serve one another, and grow in faith as we learn in the classroom, on the field, at chapel, and anywhere else we’re doing Life Together. Duties and Responsibilities Testify to personal experience of salvation in Jesus Christ, affirm belief in the University’s Statement of Faith, abide by and practice our Life Together Covenant, and both personally agree with and support the Foundational Documents of Taylor University. The appointee will teach a variety of foundational level mathematics courses as well as courses connected to departmental programs in Mathematics, Mathematics Education, and Data Science.  The candidate should be comfortable with creative pedagogy with an emphasis on group work and problem solving. The successful candidate will be expected to develop and maintain an active program of research and scholarship, including faculty-mentored student scholarship. Participation in student advising, faculty governance responsibilities, membership in professional societies, and professional service is expected. Other duties as assigned. Typical Qualifications Candidates should have an earned doctorate in Applied Mathematics, Mathematics Education, Statistics, Data Science, or a related field. ABD will be considered, as will a Master’s, with the expectation that a Doctoral degree is earned before tenure is decided. Excellence in teaching is essential, including integration of faith into the classroom.  Excellent communication and interpersonal skills are required. Mission and departmental fit are of primary importance. Preference will be given to candidates with extensive face-to-face teaching.  Preference for candidates for Mathematics Education will be given to those with experience in K-12 education.  Preference for candidates for Data Science will be given to those with experience in data analytics in a ministry or industry. Job Information Job Category: Faculty Careers - Mathematics Related Jobs Computer Science Faculty Calvin University Grand Rapids, Michigan Posted - September 9, 2026 View Mathematics & Statistics Faculty Calvin University Grand Rapids, Michigan Posted - September 9, 2026 View Tenure Track Faculty Position in Poverty and Development Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Posted - September 24, 2026 View Tenure Track Faculty Position in Ecology/Environmental Biology Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Posted - September 24, 2026 View Tenure Track Faculty Position in Christian Ministry Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Posted - September 24, 2026 View Tenure Track Faculty Position in English/Writing Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Posted - September 24, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Associate Professor of Finance Assistant Professor Of Marketing Campus Ministry Director Trending Locations Redding, California Chicago, Illinois Minnesota Wheaton, Illinois Illinois Pennsylvania Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Florida Cedarville, Ohio West Palm Beach, Florida Grand Rapids, Michigan Texas Azusa, California Ohio Birmingham, Alabama Anderson, South Carolina Michigan ORANGE CITY, Iowa Houston, Texas Longview, Texas South Carolina California Alabama St. Paul, Minnesota Iowa Charleston, South Carolina Trending Companies Wheaton College Samford University LeTourneau University Palm Beach Atlantic University Simpson University Charleston Southern University Anderson University - SC Houston Christian University InterVarsity Christian Fellowship/USA Northwestern College Calvin University Cedarville University Azusa Pacific University Moody Bible Institute Messiah University Trending Categories Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Psychology Education Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Business Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Executive Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Admissions/Registrar Accounting / Finance Faculty Careers - Fine and Performing Arts Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - Education Faculty Careers - Health Professions Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Other Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Deans Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Faculty Careers - Mathematics NonProfit Careers Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Development/Fundraising Apply for this job Find Jobs By Category Accounting / Finance Education Executive Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences NonProfit Careers Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Deans Faculty Careers - Business Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Admissions/Registrar Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Education Faculty Careers - Psychology Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Development/Fundraising Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Mathematics Faculty Careers - Fine and