    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/assistant-associate-professor-of-education-with-a-specialty-in-secondary-education-biology-charleston-south-carolina-12665": {
      "title": "Assistant/Associate Professor of Education with a Specialty in Secondary Education (Biology)",
      "description": "Assistant/Associate Professor of Education with a Specialty in Secondary Education (Biology) in Charleston, South Carolina | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Assistant/Associate Professor of Education with a Specialty in Secondary Education (Biology) Charleston Southern University Charleston, South Carolina Share Save Job Apply for This Job Summary: Charleston Southern University invites applications for a full-time tenure-track position (Assistant or Associate Professor) in the College of Education beginning August 2026 or January 2027. Charleston Southern seeks candidates who are professing Christians and are committed to excellence in teaching, scholarship, and service. They should support the goals of a strong liberal arts education and be willing to explore the integration of faith and learning with students. Rank is commensurate with experience. The successful candidate will teach a secondary biology methods course and a broad range of education courses. The candidate must be able to collaborate with teacher education faculty to maintain program excellence and coherence, develop and maintain an active research agenda, and have a record of exemplary experience as a classroom teacher. All courses are taught on campus. Opportunities to teach in the MEd and EdD programs may be available. Responsibilities: •    Teach 24 credit hours per academic year •    Supervise students during clinical practice •    Develop/revise the curriculum to reflect current trends in teacher education programs •    Serve as an advisor to CoE majors •    Recruit prospective students •    Serve on college and university committees •    Attend and participate in departmental and university functions. Job Information Job Category: Education Education: Doctorate Degree Experience: 2 - 5 years Related Jobs Assistant Professor, Music: Voice University of Northwestern - St. Paul St. Paul, Minnesota Posted - September 22, 2026 View Chair, Department of Teacher Education LeTourneau University Longview, Texas Posted - September 15, 2026 View Mathematics & Statistics Faculty Calvin University Grand Rapids, Michigan Posted - September 9, 2026 View Assistant Professor, English Department (9 Mo, TT) Samford University Birmingham, Alabama Posted - September 3, 2026 View Tenure-track, Open-rank English Faculty Mississippi Christian University Clinton, Mississippi Posted - September 3, 2026 View Tenure Track Faculty Position in Poverty and Development Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Posted - September 24, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Assistant Professor Of Marketing Associate Professor of Finance Campus Ministry Director Trending Locations Illinois St. Paul, Minnesota Charleston, South Carolina ORANGE CITY, Iowa Azusa, California West Palm Beach, Florida Houston, Texas California Alabama Chicago, Illinois Iowa Texas Birmingham, Alabama Grand Rapids, Michigan Cedarville, Ohio Wheaton, Illinois Longview, Texas Ohio Minnesota Florida Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Pennsylvania South Carolina Michigan Redding, California Trending Companies Palm Beach Atlantic University Houston Christian University Wheaton College Samford University Anderson University - SC Azusa Pacific University Simpson University Calvin University LeTourneau University InterVarsity Christian Fellowship/USA Northwestern College Charleston Southern University Moody Bible Institute Messiah University Cedarville University Trending Categories Faculty Careers - Education Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Fine and Performing Arts Faculty Careers - Mathematics Education Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Development/Fundraising Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition NonProfit Careers Faculty Careers - Psychology Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Deans Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Other Accounting / Finance Faculty Careers - Business Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Admissions/Registrar Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Executive Faculty Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Apply for this job Find Jobs By Category Accounting / Finance Education Executive Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences NonProfit Careers Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Deans Faculty Careers - Business Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Admissions/Registrar Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Education Faculty Careers - Psychology Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Development/Fundraising Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Mathematics Faculty Careers - Fine and Performing Arts Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Powered by Web Scribble Solutions , Inc. About Our Work & Mission Our Institutions Leadership Contact Us Join Us Advertise Donate Employment Membership Sponsorship Follow Us Council for Christian Colleges & Universities 20 M Street SE, Suite 350 , Washington, D.C. 20003 202.546.8713"
