    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/tenure-track-faculty-position-in-christian-ministry-lookout-mountain-georgia-12691": {
      "title": "Tenure Track Faculty Position in Christian Ministry",
      "description": "Tenure Track Faculty Position in Christian Ministry in Lookout Mountain, Georgia | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Tenure Track Faculty Position in Christian Ministry Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Share Save Job Apply for This Job The Department of Biblical and Theological Studies at Covenant College, an agency of the Presbyterian Church in America and an academically rigorous Christian college emphasizing the liberal arts in the Reformed and Presbyterian tradition invites applications for a full-time, tenure-track faculty position in Christian Ministry, beginning July 1, 2027. Rank and compensation will be commensurate with experience. All applicants must Essential Duties and Responsibilities: Teach 2-3 courses in the Covenant College core curriculum, whether Old Testament, New Testament, or Christian Doctrine. Ability to teach 2-3 courses in the Christian Doctrine sequence is especially desired. Teach 1-2 electives and/or foundational and practicum courses in Christian Ministry, including Introduction to Christian Ministry, Teaching & Discipleship, and Mentored Ministry Aid in the administration of a new Local Flourishing Project beginning in the purview of the Christian Ministry program Advise and mentor students Meet with prospective students Participate in the life of the campus community and faculty governance Necessary Qualifications: Subscription to the system of doctrine in the Westminster Confession of Faith and Catechisms. A PhD or ThD in Pastoral Theology, Christian Ministry, or related field. Exceptional Candidates may be considered before completion of PhD. The successful candidate will possess demonstrated experience and expertise in Christian ministry, pastoral theology, missions, and/or church planting. An M.Div. (preferred) or MA in Theology Prior teaching experience – with demonstrated excellence – at the college or seminary level is desired. Commitment to the mission of Covenant College Interested and qualified candidates should email the following documentation to Dr. Collin Messer, Vice President for Academic Affairs, Covenant College, at [email protected] : Letter of Interest indicating teaching and research interests Curriculum Vitae A Testimony of Christian Faith and Experience Philosophy of Christian Higher Education A Response to the Westminster Confession ( https://www.pcaac.org/bco/westminster-confession/ ) indicating agreement, along with any scruples (and rationales) to the Confession Dr. Collin Messer Vice President for Academic Affairs Covenant College 14049 Scenic Highway Lookout Mountain, GA 30750 Email: [email protected] Job Information Job Category: Faculty Careers - Other Education: Doctorate Degree Position Type: Full Time Related Jobs Tenure Track Faculty Position in Poverty and Development Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Posted - September 24, 2026 View Tenure Track Faculty Position in Finance Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Posted - September 24, 2026 View FACULTY POSITION in Department of Sports Medicine & Exercise Science Belhaven University Jackson, Mississippi Posted - September 10, 2026 View Full-time Faculty in Applied Health Sciences Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Full-time Faculty in Biblical Studies Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Full-time Faculty in Psychology Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Assistant Professor Of Marketing Associate Professor of Finance Campus Ministry Director Trending Locations Redding, California Indiana Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Illinois Charleston, South Carolina Pennsylvania ORANGE CITY, Iowa Cedarville, Ohio Houston, Texas Iowa Birmingham, Alabama Al