    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/tenure-track-faculty-position-in-finance-lookout-mountain-georgia-12689": {
      "title": "Tenure Track Faculty Position in Finance",
      "description": "Tenure Track Faculty Position in Finance in Lookout Mountain, Georgia | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Tenure Track Faculty Position in Finance Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Share Save Job Apply for This Job The Business Department at Covenant College, an agency of the Presbyterian Church in America and an academically rigorous Christian college emphasizing the liberal arts in the Reformed and Presbyterian tradition, invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position beginning July 1, 2027. Rank and compensation will be commensurate with experience. The Business Department at Covenant College is seeking someone with a degree in Business/Finance and professional experience and expertise to teach a variety of courses in the department’s finance and accounting concentrations. In addition to teaching Principles of Finance, Corporate Financial Management, and Investments, the ideal candidate will also be able to teach one or more of the following courses: Principles of Accounting, Cost Accounting, Business Law, Statistics. Essential Duties and Responsibilities: Teach a mix of business and core courses for a total of four classes each semester Advise and mentor students Meet with prospective students Participate in the life of the campus community and faculty governance Qualifications: A terminal degree (PhD or DBA) in Business/Finance from a regionally accredited institution Demonstrated excellence in teaching Practitioner experience in Business/Finance that will elevate academic instruction in the classroom and help prepare students for careers in the field Interest in mentoring undergraduates Commitment to the mission of Covenant College Interested and qualified candidates should email the following documentation to Dr. Collin Messer, Vice President for Academic Affairs, Covenant College, at [email protected] : Letter of Interest indicating teaching and research interests Curriculum Vitae A Testimony of Christian Faith and Experience Philosophy of Christian Higher Education A Response to the Westminster Confession (located at https://www.pcaac.org/bco/westminster-confession/ indicating agreement, and any scruples, with rationales, with the Confession Dr. Collin Messer Vice President for Academic Affairs Covenant College 14049 Scenic Highway Lookout Mountain, GA 30750 Email: [email protected] Job Information Job Category: Faculty Careers - Business Education: Doctorate Degree Position Type: Full Time Related Jobs Tenure Track Faculty Position in Poverty and Development Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Posted - September 24, 2026 View Tenure Track Faculty Position in Christian Ministry Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Posted - September 24, 2026 View FACULTY POSITION in Department of Sports Medicine & Exercise Science Belhaven University Jackson, Mississippi Posted - September 10, 2026 View Full-time Faculty in Applied Health Sciences Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Full-time Faculty in Biblical Studies Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Full-time Faculty in Psychology Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Assistant Professor Of Marketing Campus Ministry Director Associate Professor of Finance Trending Locations Birmingham, Alabama Indiana Upland, Indiana Alabama Georgia Cedarville, Ohio St. Paul, Minnesota Lookout Mountain, Georgia Minnesota California Michigan Redding, California Longview, Texas Texas Wheaton, Illinois Charleston, South Carolina Grand Rapids, Michigan South Carolina Ohio Azusa, California Illinois Florida ORANGE CITY, Iowa Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Pennsylvania Chicago, Illinois Iowa Houston, Texas West Palm Beach, Fl