    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/tenure-track-faculty-position-in-business-and-sport-management-lookout-mountain-georgia-12688": {
      "title": "Tenure Track Faculty Position in Business and Sport Management",
      "description": "Tenure Track Faculty Position in Business and Sport Management in Lookout Mountain, Georgia | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Tenure Track Faculty Position in Business and Sport Management Covenant College Lookout Mountain, Georgia Share Save Job Apply for This Job The Sport Management Program in the Department of Business at Covenant College, an agency of the Presbyterian Church in America and an academically rigorous Christian college emphasizing the liberal arts in the Reformed and Presbyterian tradition, invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position beginning July 1, 2027. Rank and compensation will be commensurate with experience. The candidate who fills this position will be someone with both academic and practitioner experience in sport management or business with a sports focus, who is capable of teaching a variety of undergraduate sport management and business courses. Essential Duties and Responsibilities: Teach a variety of undergraduate courses in core areas within the sport management and business majors Teaching load: 24 credits per academic year, with a course release in the first semester Engage in research, scholarship, and other professional activities Collaborate with the sports industry by working on real-world events alongside students, providing experiential learning opportunities Mentor and advise undergraduate students Participate in the life of the campus community and faculty governance Qualifications: A Ph.D. in Sport Management, Business Administration, or related business area (Economics, Finance, Analytics, etc.) from an accredited institution is preferred. ABD candidates or candidates with a Master's Degree in Sport Management, an MBA, or JD with relevant experience working in sport will also be considered. The ideal candidate will have prior teaching and/or research experience in sport business, or a business area that touches/connects to the sport industry. Practitioner experience in sport management/business that will elevate academic instruction in the classroom and help prepare students for careers in the field Commitment to the mission of Covenant College Interested and qualified candidates should send the following documentation to Dr. Collin Messer: Curriculum Vitae A Testimony of Christian Faith and Experience Philosophy of Christian Higher Education A Response to the Westminster Confession (located at https://www.pcaac.org/bco/westminster-confession/ indicating agreement, and any scruples, with rationales, with the Confession Job Information Job Category: Faculty Careers - Business Education: Doctorate Degree Position Type: Full Time Related Jobs Full-time Faculty in Applied Health Sciences Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Full-time Faculty in Biblical Studies Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Full-time Faculty in Psychology Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Full-Time Mechanical, or Biomedical Engineering, or Engineering Physics Faculty Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Full-time Faculty in Biology Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Full-time Electrical Engineering or Engineering Physics Faculty Messiah University Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Posted - September 25, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Assistant Professor Of Marketing Campus Ministry Director Associate Professor of Finance Trending Locations Grand Rapids, Michigan West Palm Beach, Florida Iowa St. Paul, Minnesota Chicago, Illinois Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Ohio Michigan Pennsylvania Birmingham, Alabama Charleston, South Carolina Alabama Redding, California ORANGE CITY, Iowa Azusa, Califor