    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/tenure-track-in-exercise-science-upland-indiana-12687": {
      "title": "Tenure-Track in Exercise Science",
      "description": "Tenure-Track in Exercise Science in Upland, Indiana | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Tenure-Track in Exercise Science Taylor University Upland, Indiana Share Save Job Apply for This Job Taylor University is seeking applications for a tenure-track faculty position in the Kinesiology Department beginning in August, 2027, teaching primarily in the area of exercise science. Mission and Commitment Taylor's mission is to develop servant-leaders marked with a passion to minister Christ’s redemptive love, grace, and truth to a world in need. As a community, Taylor faculty, staff, and students commit to living out Christ’s love and truth in the here and now. We worship together, serve one another, and grow in faith as we learn in the classroom, on the field, at chapel, and anywhere else we’re doing Life Together. Duties and Responsibilities This position is primarily responsible to: Testify to personal experience of salvation in Jesus Christ, affirm belief in the University’s Statement of Faith, abide by and practice our Life Together Covenant, and both personally agree with and support the Foundational Documents of Taylor University. Teach a variety of courses that may include Physiology of Exercise, Applied Nutrition, Research Methods, Lifespan Physiology, Biomechanics, general education courses, among others. The candidate should be comfortable with creative pedagogy. Develop and maintain an active program of faculty-mentored student research and scholarship. Be involved in interdisciplinary and outreach-oriented health science initiatives. Participate in student advising, faculty governance, and professional organizations. Other Duties as assigned Typical Qualifications Required: earned doctorate in Exercise Science or a related field (ABD considered) Required: excellence in teaching, including integration of faith in the classroom and discipline. Required: strong communication and interpersonal skills. Preferred experience with face-to-face teaching Preferred experience with research or clinical experience in Exercise Science or a related field Supplemental Information The Kinesiology Department offers majors in Exercise Science and Human Physiology and Preventive Medicine, as well as minors in Coaching and Preventive Medicine. The department has 6 full-time faculty and is housed in the Eichling Aquatics Wing of the Kesler Student Activities Center. Job Information Job Category: Faculty Careers - Other Related Jobs Visiting Professor-Biology Southern Nazarene University Bethany, Oklahoma Posted - September 25, 2026 View Associate Provost/Dean of Arts and Sciences Simpson University Redding, California Posted - September 21, 2026 View Assistant/ Associate Professor of Biology or Kinesiology Simpson University Redding, California Posted - September 15, 2026 View Full time Faculty, Counseling Psychology - College of Education and Behavioral Sciences Azusa Pacific University Azusa, California Posted - August 27, 2026 View Full-time Faculty, Marriage and Family Therapy - College of Education and Behavioral Sciences Azusa Pacific University Azusa, California Posted - August 27, 2026 View Faculty, Clinical Psychology - College of Education and Behavioral Sciences Azusa Pacific University Azusa, California Posted - August 27, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Assistant Professor Of Marketing Campus Ministry Director Associate Professor of Finance Trending Locations Alabama Ohio South Carolina Birmingham, Alabama California Minnesota Charleston, South Carolina Florida Chicago, Illinois Georgia Houston, Texas West Palm Beach, Florida Longview, Texas Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Azusa, California ORANGE CITY, Iowa Michigan Cedarville, Ohio Redding, California Wheaton, Illinois Illinois Grand Rapids, Michigan Texas St. Paul, Minnesota Lookout Mountain, Georgia Indiana Iowa Pennsylvania Upland, Indiana Trending Companies Cedarville University Wheaton College Northwestern College Covenant College Houston Christian University Charleston Southern University Anderson University - SC Palm Beach Atlantic University Azusa Pacific University Simpson University Messiah University Calvin University Moody Bible Institute LeTourneau University InterVarsity Christian Fellowship/USA Taylor University Samford University Trending Categories Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Deans Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Education Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Fine and Performing Arts Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Psychology Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Development/Fundraising Faculty Careers - Business Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Other Accounting / Finance Education Executive NonProfit Careers Faculty Careers - Mathematics Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Admissions/Registrar Faculty Careers - Engineering Apply for this job Find Jobs By Category Accounting / Finance Education Executive Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences NonProfit Careers Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Deans Faculty Careers - Business Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Admissions/Registrar Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Other Faculty Careers - Education Faculty Careers - Psychology Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Development/Fundraising Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Computer science Faculty Careers - Mathematics Faculty Careers - Fine and Performing Arts Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - English Literature and Composition Powered by Web Scribble Solutions , Inc. About Our Work & Mis